{
  "_notes": [
    "Generated by searching for opcode sequences in ROM images.",
    "The 3.x and 4.x sets moved to lotr41.map.json: that firmware stores the adjustments checksum at 0x1FBD, not 0x1FC1.",
    "Adjustments 0x1E00-0x1E5F are protected by a plain 8-bit sum (complement false) at 0x1FC1, read from the checksum routine in lotrcpu.500 (lotr5), lotrcpu.501 (lotr51), lotrcpu.600 (lotr6), lotrcpul.500 (lotr_sp5), lotrcpul.501 (lotr_s51), lotrcpul.600 (lotr_sp6): LDAB #$60 / LDX #$1E00 / ADDA ,X+ / DECB / BNE, then STAA $1FC1."
  ],
